---
// Werbebalken ganz oben auf der Startseite: Gentlemen's Strength (Männergruppe 40+)
// Führt direkt zur Warteliste auf /gentlemens-strength/
---

<a
  href="/gentlemens-strength/#warteliste"
  class="relative z-30 block text-white hover:brightness-110 transition"
  style="background: var(--gradient-orange);"
>
  <div class="section-container px-4 py-3 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-center">
    <span class="font-bold text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug">
      <span class="uppercase tracking-wider text-xs sm:text-sm opacity-90 mr-1">Neu:</span>
      Jetzt bei der Gentlemen's Strength Community anmelden
      <span class="block sm:inline font-normal text-xs sm:text-sm opacity-90 sm:ml-1">Start 8. Januar · nur 15 Plätze</span>
    </span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white text-orange font-bold text-sm px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full whitespace-nowrap shadow">
      Jetzt anmelden
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
      </svg>
    </span>
  </div>
</a>
